          "html": "<p><b>The arts and human experience</b></p><p>Some people may claim that the arts serve no useful purpose, that they achieve nothing measurable and help nobody. But there are many clear examples of their usefulness, such as the inter-dependent relationship between music and [[19]] , or between the visual arts and the [[20]] business. A dramatist may use a [[21]] to draw our attention to various issues in society, for example some kind of injustice which needs correcting. Apart from these obvious practical benefits, there are other benefits that we gain from things, such as the [[22]] we find in an artist's work.</p>"
